    <summary>Backup and export all Evernote notes and notebooks</summary>
    <description>Backup your notes and notebooks from Evernote locally and export them at any time.

## Features

- Quickly sync all your notes into a SQLite database for backup
- Export all backed up notes in `*.enex` format, as notebooks or single notes
- Support for both [Evernote](https://evernote.com/) and [Yinxiang (印象笔记)](https://yinxiang.com/)

## Usage

```
evernote-backup init-db
evernote-backup sync
evernote-backup export output_dir/
```

## Notes

- Windows x64 (CLI portable binary; ARM64 Windows runs it via emulation)
- Adds `evernote-backup` to PATH
- PyInstaller binaries are sometimes flagged as false positives by antivirus software</description>
